{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"10":"The Book of Lost and Found Items"},"section_detail":{"10":{"hadithnumber_first":1701,"hadithnumber_last":1720,"arabicnumber_first":1701,"arabicnumber_last":1720,"name_native":"كتاب المفقودات والموجودات"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1711,"arabicnumber":1711,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن العلاء، حدثنا ابو اسامة، عن الوليد، - يعني ابن كثير - حدثني عمرو بن شعيب، باسناده بهذا قال في ضالة الشاء قال \" فاجمعها","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":10,"hadith":11}}]}